() Tj
T*
(2. Access control) Tj
T*
(Production access uses SSO plus hardware security keys. Privileged roles are reviewed) Tj
T*
(quarterly. Shared root passwords are forbidden.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Retention) Tj
T*
(Customer documents remain until the customer deletes them or the contract ends. Traces for) Tj
T*
(Starter accounts are deleted after 7 days. Team traces after 90 days. Enterprise traces) Tj
T*
(after 365 days unless a legal hold is active.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Encryption) Tj
T*
(Data in transit uses TLS 1.2 or newer. Data at rest in PostgreSQL uses AES-256. Embedding) Tj
T*
(indexes inherit the same volume encryption.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Vendor LLM use) Tj
T*
(Customer content must not be sent to a third-party model provider unless the customer has) Tj
T*
